Composition. - The provinces of Maguindanao del Norte and Maguindanao del Sur shall be composed of the following municipalities:
(a) Province of Maguindanao del Norte
(1) Barira;
(2) Buldon;
(3) Datu Blah Sinsuat;
(4) Datu Odin Sinsuat;
(5) Kabuntalan;
(6) Matanog;
(7) Northern Kabuntalan;
(8) Parang;
(9) North Upi;
(10) Sultan Kudarat;
(11) Sultan Mastura; and
(12) Talitay.
(b) Province of Maguindanao del Sur
(1) Ampatuan;
(2) Buluan;
(3) Datu Abdulla Sangki;
(4) Datu Anggal Midtimbang;
(5) Datu Hoffer Ampatuan;
